  "agent_notes": [
    "The NIRF listing uses the spellings BHULANDSHAR and BULANDHAHR; the official site uses Bulandshahr and gives the matching Gijhori campus address.",
    "Normal TLS verification hit the managed proxy self-signed certificate-in-chain error for nirfindia.org and grimt.co.in. Public GETs were retried with curl --insecure after confirming the expected official hostnames.",
    "The official homepage and Our Courses archive expose six current programme pages: B.Sc, MBA, B.A., B.C.A, B.Com., and B.B.A. The separate official Courses page only states 3-year B.A. and B.Com., while About Us mentions B.Ed and the corresponding current course page is titled B.C.A. This internal inconsistency prevents a complete catalogue verification; B.Ed was not imported as an active course.",
    "No official page explicitly states eligibility. Duration was left null except for the explicit 3-year statements on the official Courses page. Programme mode is not stated officially. Search snippets and prohibited aggregators were not used as verification evidence."
  ]
